    "notes": [
      "<b>Needed</b>: <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Irit_potion_(unfinished)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Irit potion (unfinished)</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chopped_onions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chopped onions</a>",
      "• Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Darren_Lightfinger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Darren Lightfinger</a> just inside of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Thieves%27_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thieves&#39; Guild</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge</a>. (✓)<br>• Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chief_Thief_Robin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chief Thief Robin</a>. (3)<br>• Use a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bowl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bowl</a> on an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Onion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">onion</a> to make <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chopped_onion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chopped onion</a>.<br>• Use <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Irit_potion_(unfinished)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">irit potion (unfinished)</a> with <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chopped_onion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chopped onion</a> to get a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_stench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of stench</a>.<br>• Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chief_Thief_Robin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chief Thief Robin</a> to get a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_stench_(a)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of stench (a)</a>.<br>• If it does not work, talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Darren_Lightfinger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Darren Lightfinger</a> about a disguise, and then talk to Robin again."
    ]
  },
